  "notes": "{夜|よる}ご{飯|はん} is a casual word for dinner.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {晩|ばん}ご{飯|はん}: dinner (also casual, slightly more common in some regions)\n- {夕食|ゆうしょく}: dinner (formal, used in writing and announcements)\n- {夕飯|ゆうはん}: dinner (neutral to slightly formal)\n- {晩|ばん}{飯|めし}: dinner (masculine, rough)\n\nMEAL WORDS:\n- {朝|あさ}ご{飯|はん}: breakfast\n- {昼|ひる}ご{飯|はん}: lunch\n- {夜|よる}ご{飯|はん}: dinner",
